    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d630">

                <pb facs="0751" n="649" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg649"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/458: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Arnold</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-04T18:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 4,
                                1918, 6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            February 4, 1 p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>China requests, pending final tariff revision, a temporary surcharge involving 50
                    per cent advance in valid basis on present tariff allowing an optional 5 per
                    cent <hi rendition="#italic">ad valorem</hi> on present Hong Kong valuations on
                    any disputed items. American delegation favorable. Does Department sanction?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arnold</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
